<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 TI - LYN56.USFM K.KACHINDA NT 2 TIMOTY</book>
  <para style="h">Timoteya no wiili</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliñolo lya Paulusi no wiili kwa Timoteya</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoteya</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tmy</para>
  <para style="mt2">Elin̄olo lya Paulusi kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTEYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Okulimukisa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka ya Timoteya no wiili ni buka no wili ya mutumiwa Paulusi eyo ana kun̄olela ku mwiyeti waye Timoteya. Timoteya no wiili kame ina kun̄oliwa beebi ni mamaneneno no upilo wa Paulusi. Kame ana kubeekiwa mu tolongo mu Loma munako yaye (1.16). Paulusi kame ana kutenda oulikani no kongola ni Timoteya mane enako no kupula kame ana kumwisananga nji mwanaye (Fillipi 2.22), Timoteya no wiili (1.2; 1.18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Eyi einjili no tibuka tinee eto tiyuleka ku munu kasa ku Keleke. Etaatu tinjili ni Timoteya wiili, Tite, mane ni Filimoni. Enako eyo lina kun̄oliwa elin̄olo lya Timoteya no wiili asikulapela mu mubuso no Maloma kame ana kuyandiswangwa. Mwendi eli elibaka elyo ana kunungeliwa Paulusi mi kame ana kulaelanga Timoteya nji akongote mu mayando. Kanyi mu Timoteya no weli, Paulusi kame aba etitemuso no kupula oku kumanena ni aiyeti no mapwa (1 Timoteya 1.16-18). Paulusi kame ambela Timoteya nji mbakwikala enako no utata kuuso (3.1)</para>
  <para style="iot">Emitwi no titaba</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi kame atateka mu kukeeta Timoteya (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Cwale kame ambela Timoteya nji akongote (2.1-13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Esisikon̄elelako kame amuba etitaelo mukupula (2.14-26).</para>
  <para style="io1">Cwale kame amutobosa eyi saitendahale kuuso mane noomo afanena okutambulela (3.1-4; 8).</para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi kame amana ni maywi aye no kumanenena kwa Timoteya (4.9-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Mene Paulusi, omutumiwa wa Kilesite Jesu mukusinga kwa Nyambe okukumanena ni ku sepiso no omoyo owo oli mwa Kilesite Jesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Kame nin̄olela Timoteya, omwanange nisinga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Obiwe esishemo, amakeke mane ni kozo eyi itunda kwa Nyambe Sitange mane nikwa Kilesite Jesu Ombumu wetu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okutumela ni Kususuweziwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Kame ni kutumela kwa Nyambe woyo ni sebeleza ni lizwalo no kukena, kanyi anjekulyetu omo ana kutendela aba nikuhupula mu nako yonje mu titapelo tange. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Kame nihupula emyoti yowe, ousiku ni munji kame nishukele okumona nji cwale niiyale okuwabelelwa. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Kame ni yambuta ni tumelo yowe no kwakesheba, etumelo ina kwikala oweli mwa nyakulyowe Loisi ni mwa inawowe Yunisi. Kame nikolwa luli nji nimwa wene kweeli. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Mulibaka elyo nisi kupulukisa nji ofutelele empo ya Nyambe eyo ili mwa wene aba nina kukubeeka amaoko ange beulu. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Kakuli Nyambe kasituba Emebo no umowa, kono wa kongota, ni wa lilato, nou no ukusiulula wenyene.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Cwale olese okwenena okwamba oupaki wa Mbumu wetu simba okwamba eyange mene elipanditi lyaye. Kono tukutabele kumayando mulibaka no liywi no kuwaba mu maata a Nyambe. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Woyo ona tuyoyisa ni kutwiisana, okwisaniwa no kukena kasa mu libaka no misebezi yetu kono mu libaka no kusinga kwaye mane ni sishemo eso ana kutuba mwa Kelesite Jesu kunyima elitunga elyakalya sumbiwa kale, <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>mi cwale bano esishemo nasi monahalisiwa mukwiiya kwa muyoyisi wetu Kilesite Jesu woyo ona mana elifu nikulita omoyo mane nikulita omoyo no kwaafa mu liseli mulibaka no liywi no kuwaba.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Lyonyene eliywi no kuwaba nina beekiwa okutenda omukutazi, omutumiwa mane ni mwiyeti walyo, <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>cwalehe bokame aba ni yanda aba nisebeza. Kono kanienisiwa kakuli kame niyii woyo ina pumene mwa yonyene mi kame nikolwa nji kame atwesa okubabalela eyo nina beeke kwa yonyene okutwala ba liywaa sauke. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Cwale okon̄e omwanda no maywi no kuwaba no niti awo ona yupu kwa mene, mu tumelo mane nimu lilato eyo ili mwa Kelesite Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Omamele eyi no niti eyi ina beekiwa mu pabalelo yowe, mu Mebo no Kukena woyo oyoya mwaaci.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Kame olimukile nji onje awo ali mu Asiya nani futukele okunilwisa, mwa onyene kame kuli Figalusi ni Hemogenisi. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Ombumu ashemube asindoo ya Onesifolasi, kakuli kame ani katulusanga. Kasi kwenena okunungiwa kwange. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Kono aba ana kukeela mu Loma sebeli oni saela mane nikuni wana. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Ombumu amube esishemo okutunda kwa Mbumu Nyambe ba liywaa elyo mane kame olimukile wino omo ana kunituseta mu Efese.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Omusole no Kuwaba wa Kilesite Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Cwale wene omwanange, ongole mu sishemo eso sili mwa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Mi eyi ona yupu kwa mene balubala no tipaki no kupula, oibeeke kwanu no kusepahala, awo satwese okwiiyeta anjili kame.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Okutabele mu mayando kanyi omusole no kuwaba wa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Kakwisa omusole oli ba musebezi woyo okwingenyeka mu musebezi wa woyo nokwatenda omusole, kakuli omulelo waye waku wabelisa woyo ona mubeeke ba musebezi. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Omunu oli mu takano kabiwi omupuzo no takano, konji aba alakana okukumanena ni mulawo. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Osikulima mu koongola yosowana oweli kweyo ina kutuliwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Opuluke kweyo naamba, kakuli Ombumu mbakubi okuyupisisa mu inu yonje.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Opuluke Jesu Kilesite woyo ona kwinguka kwaafu, no lusika lwa Dabida, kanyi omo ina kutaleziwa mu liywi lyange no kuwaba. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Eliywi no kuwaba elyo ina yandele ni kunungiwa mu tungongolo kanyi osisinyi. Kono eliywi lya Nyambe kalisi nungiwa mu tungongolo. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Cwalehe kame nongota einu yonje mulibaka no awo ana ketiwa nji nonyene awane okuyoyisiwa mwa Kilesite Jesu ni kanya no kwaabwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Omwambelo ni waniti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">“Nji kame tufile naye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:11">mbatuyoyo naye.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Nji kame tukoongota mu mayando,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">mbatubusa naye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">nji kame tumukana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:12">niyonyene mbakatukana.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Nji aci katu kwite etumelo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">yonyene wa kusepahala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2TI 2:13">kakuli katwese oukukana yonyene.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omubeleki ona Pumeniwa kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Wa pulukise eyi, mane nikwalemusa balubala lwa Mbumu nji alese okukanana ni maywi. Kaikwite tuso kono konji feela okusinya awo ateeteta. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Otenda omo tweseta nji okubeeke wenyene kwa Nyambe kanyi omubeleki no kulumelelwa, omubeleki woyo kakwite etaba nikwena woyo oiyeta eliywi no niti. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Mwambuke omwambelo no kwiiba, kakuli kame yekeza okutwala anu ku kufosa onene. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Omwambelo woo kame okufekile kanyi esitombo no kwabala. Mukaci koo kame kuli Hemenaeyasi ni Filetasi, <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>okame awo anatundu mu niti aamba nji okwinguka no afu naku tendahala. Kame akwisa etumelo no akoo. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Kono omusumo no koongola wa Nyambe osimanine obeekilwe eliswayo “Ombumu kame ayii awo ali aye” mi “Omunu yonje woyo oisana elitina lya Mbumu atunde ku kutenda eyi no kwiiba” <verse eid="2TI 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Cwale mu ndoo no kuneneba kakwisa fela eiwana no gauda ni silibela kono kame kuli ngeso neyi no itondo ni limaa, einjili ya kukutekeha einjili yano kwakutekeha. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Nji omunu kame akukenisa yonyene okutunda kwiinu no kwiiba, cwale mbatende esibelekiso sili ni tuso, okukutekeha ni tuso ku munya ndoo, woyo otatelele omusebezi wonje no kuwaba. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Ocile etitakazo no undumbana, kono otwalelele eyi no kuluka, ni tumelo, ni lilato, ni kozo, bamweya nanu onje a alapela Ombumu ni mucima no kukena. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Okane etin̄ananyi no welo na mbulwa etingana, mu kulimuka nji kame tilita okulwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Cwale omubika wa Mbumu ka lukele okulwa, kono kame alukela okutenda woyo no musa kwanu onje, woyo otwesa okwiyeta ni mucima no kuwaba, <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Woyo ofanena okusiulula ao amulwisa ni mucima no kuluka, kakuli mwendi Nyambe mbaabi okubaka mane nji alimuke eniti. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Cwale atwese okupicuka mu malaba a Satani woyo waswazize nji atende esi sisingwa kwa yonyene<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Okuyoya nambulwa Nyambe mu maywaa no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Kono oyupisise eyi nji mu maywaa no mamaneneno, kame sakwiye tinako no kubambaba. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Kakuli anu kame sa kusinge onyene, asikusinga amali, akuyeema, oukukuumusa, anyefuli, awo akana oku yupa ashemi oo, awo aulwile okutumela, awo akana einu ya ouwa, awo no kwakena, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>awo no kuulwa elilato, asin̄ole, asi kooba anu ni mapwa, awo no kwakulema, asikutweba, awo atimba einu no kuwaba, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>asi kushemba, amatanya, asiku kununeka, awo asinga eminyaka okubita okusinga Nyambe, <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>awo akumonisa nji aasikupumena, kono kame akana amaata no uasikupumena. Ocile anu no ngeso. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Kakuli mukaci koo kame kuli awo aingena mu tindoo no anu ni kununga akati no kufokola, awo aimelwe ku ibi ni kulakaza eiminyaka no kupula, <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>awo ayupeteta kwanu feela mane kakeela ba kulimuka eniti. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Kanyi Janesi ni Jambulesi aba ana kukananisa Mushe, cwale alume awo nonyene kame akanana eniti, anu no kwanahana wino mane kame ana tauka mu tumelo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Kono katamba oku twalelela, kakuli owelo woo mba umonahala kwanu onje, kanyi uya no alume ayiili aya.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etitaelo no Mamaneneno kwa Timoteya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Cwale bano nu limuka etuto yange luli, nomu ni tendelanga, ni milelo yange mu moyo, etumelo yange, ni mucima wange no kuwaba, ni lilato lyange, nu koongota kwange, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>amayando ange, okuyandisiwa kwange, oko kuna niiyele ku Antiyoki, ni ku Ikoniyamu ni ku Lisitila, mu mayando ao kame ni na kongota, mi Ombumu na nilamulele kweyo yonje. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Niti luli awo onje asaela okuyoya mu moyo no uasikupumena oli mwa Kilesite Jesu kame sa yandisiwe, <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>kono anu no kwiiba na ongi, kame sa twalelele onene mu uyi, me alemine okonga anu, mi kame aongiwa nonyene. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Kono wene otwalelele kweyi ona kwiyete mane ongotete eyo ona pumenemi kame olimukile woyo ona kwiyeteyo, <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>okutunda ku wanuke wowe kame uyii aman̄olo no kukena, awo atwesa okusimweta eyo no kuyoyisiwa mu kupumena mwa Kilesite Jesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Aman̄olo onje kame anan̄oliwa mu kususuweziwa kwa Nyambe mi kame ali ni tuso mu kwiyeta, mu kukolwisa, mu kulukisa mane ni mukumonisa okuluka, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>nji cwale omunu wa Nyambe a petahale mane afanene okutenda omusebezi onje no kuwaba.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ekatulo kame Ikeyile mutende Omusebezi wenu wino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Kame ni kulaela bouso wa Nyambe ni wa Mbumu Kilesite Jesu woyo soatula awo ayoya nawo asikufa, enako saiye ni mubuso waye <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>okutaze eliywi, ongote mu nako no kuwaba neeyi no kwiiba, ukolwise, okalimele, osusuweze mi otenda ngeso ni mucima no kuwaba ni mane nimu kwiyeta. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Kakuli enako kame iiya eyo anu kame sakane etuto no kuwaba, kono bakwikala ni matwi nokuyuwa mbaku saelele aiyeti oo awo sate mu titakazo too. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Kame satunde muku teeteta eniti mi kame sayaulukele mu matangu. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Kono wene enako yonje okutukisete, wongole mu mayando, otenda omusebezi no kwamba eliywi, oiyatetete eyi no situlo sowe.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Kakuli mene kame nili ba nako no kutendiwa esitabelo, enako no kuta kwange naikeela. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Kame ni nalwi endwa no kuwaba, na keela kale ba mamaneneno, kame nina teula etumelo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Mi cwale kame nibeekelwe ekuwani no kuluka, eyo Ombumu, omwatuli no kuluka, kame saibe kwa mene ba liywaa no katulo mane kasa mene feela kono ngeso ni kwawo onje ana singi okwiiya kwaye.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amaywi Ange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Otenda omo sotwesete monje okwiiye kwa mene muwangu. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Kakuli Damasi kame ana ni fulalele mu ku singa elitunga mi kame anati ku Tesalonika. Kilesenisi kame anati ku Galatiya, Tite kame anati ku Dalumatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luka yokame fela oli ni mene. Oshimbe Maleka oiye naye, kakuli niwaotokwa onene mu kunitusa mu musebezi. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Kame ni na tumu Tayikikasi ku Efese. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Aba sawiye, oni shimbele omukanjo ni nasiyi ku Tulowasi kwa Kapusi, olite ni tibuka mane niitumba inapungiwa abo ina n̄olo.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Alekizanda, ombuti no yondo kame ana ni tende ouyi onene, Ombumu mba mu usete okukumanena ni misebezi yaye. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Omu tokomele ni wene, kakuli kame ana kulwisa amaywi etu onene.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Enako inaku kutambwela ba weli kakwisa woyo ona kuniimanena, onje kame ana kuni futukela. Alese okubalelwa omubonda owo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Kono Ombumu na kuni imanena mane kuniba amaata no kwamba eliywi no niti elyo asimacaba aliyupe, mi kame ina lamulelwe ku kanwa ka Ndee. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Ombumu mba ni lamwene niku misebezi no kwiiba yonje mane niku niyoyisa oku ni ingenyeka mu mubuso waye na ku wilu. Kwa yonyene kwikale ekanya, mu tinako ni tinako! Ameni.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okukeeta no Mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Okeete Pulisika ni Akwila, na sindoo ya Onesifolasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elasitasi nasiyala mu Kolinte. Tulofimasi ina musiyi yotomine ku Miletasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Weteke omo sotwesete monje okwiiya omubebo owaka sikeela kale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Eubulusi, Pudensi, Linasi, ni Kulaudiya na beetu onje kame akukeeta.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Ombumu aikale ni mebo yenu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Esishemo siikale naanyi moonje.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
